                        "operationRef":"#/paths/~1assetFailureEvents~1action~1fetchApplicableFailureSet/post",
                        "description":"Performs custom action and fetches one applicable failureset based on the matching object_type_code of failure set associations with asset_id as an input.For object_type_code ORA_ASSET it checks asset_id and for ORA_ITEM it checks item_id and for ORA_CATEGORY it checks item_category_id against objcet_id and returns one applicable failure set. If no conditions matched the default seeded failure set with ORA_ALL object_type_code is returned"
                    }
                }
            },
