                "in":"path",
                "description":"This is the hash key of the attributes which make up the composite key for the Work Order Dispatch Lists resource and used to uniquely identify an instance of Work Order Dispatch Lists. The client should not generate the hash key value. Instead, the client should query on the Work Order Dispatch Lists collection resource in order to navigate to a specific instance of Work Order Dispatch Lists to get the hash key.",
