            "inspectionPlans-finder":{
                "name":"finder",
                "in":"query",
                "description":"Used as a predefined finder to search the collection.<br><br>Format ?finder=&lt;finderName&gt;;&lt;variableName&gt;=&lt;variableValue&gt;,&lt;variableName2&gt;=&lt;variableValue2&gt;<br><br>The following are the available finder names and corresponding finder variables<br><br><ul><li>PrimaryKey Finds the inspection plan that matches the primary key criteria specified. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>InspectionPlanId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the inspection plan. </li></ul></li><li>findByInspectionPlanName Finds the inspection plan that matches the inspection plan name specified. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>Name; string;  Indicates the name of an inspection plan. </li></ul></li><li>findInspectionPlans Finds the inspection plan based on the criteria specified. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>bindApprover; string;  Identifies the user who approved the plan. </li><li>bindAssetGroup; string;  Alphanumeric value that identifies the asset group of the asset to inspect if inspection plan type is Asset. </li><li>bindAssetGroupId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the asset group of the asset to inspect if inspection plan type is Asset. </li><li>bindAssetId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the asset number to inspect if inspection plan type is Asset. </li><li>bindAssetNumber; string;  Alphanumeric value that identifies the asset number to inspect if inspection plan type is Asset. </li><li>bindCatalogName; string;  Name; string;  of the catalog to inspect if inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. </li><li>bindCategoryId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the category of the item to inspect if inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. </li><li>bindCategoryName; string;  Name; string;  of the category of the item to inspect if inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. </li><li>bindCategorySetId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the catalog of the item to inspect if inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. </li><li>bindEnabledFlag; string;  Contains one of the following values Yes or No. If Yes, then inspection plan is enabled. If No, then inspection plan is disabled. The default value is Yes. </li><li>bindEndDate; string;  End date when the inspection plan is no longer in effect. </li><li>bindInspectionLevelId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the inspection level. </li><li>bindInspectionLevelName; string;  Name; string;  of the inspection level. </li><li>bindInventoryItemId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the item that the inspection plan references if the inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. </li><li>bindItemNumber; string;  Alphanumeric value that identifies the item that the inspection plan references if the inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. </li><li>bindItemRevision; string;  Value that identifies the revision of the item if the inspection plan type is one of the following values Receiving, Inventory, Asset, or Work in Process. This attribute is optional. </li><li>bindName; string;  Name; string;  of the inspection plan. </li><li>bindOptional; string;  Contains one of the following values Yes or No. If Yes, then inspection plan is optional. If No, then inspection plan is mandatory. The default value is No. </li><li>bindOrganizationCode; string;  Abbreviation that identifies the organization. </li><li>bindOrganizationId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the organization that the inspection plan references. </li><li>bindOrganizationName; string;  Name; string;  of the organization. </li><li>bindOwner; string;  Name; string;  of the user who created the inspection plan. </li><li>bindResourceId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the resource under the work center to inspect if inspection plan type is Resource. </li><li>bindResourceName; string;  Name; string;  of the resource under the work center to inspect if inspection plan type is Resource. </li><li>bindStartDate; string;  Start date and time when the inspection plan is in effect. The default value is the current system date and time. </li><li>bindStatus; string;  Status of the inspection plan. Valid values include New, On hold, Obsolete, and Approved. A list of accepted values is defined in the lookup type ORA_QA_IP_STATUSES. The default value is New. </li><li>bindType; string;  Type of inspection plan. Valid values are Receiving, Inventory, Work in Process, Asset, and Resource. A list of accepted values is defined in the lookup type ORA_QA_IP_TYPES. </li><li>bindVersion; string;  Version number of the inspection plan. </li><li>bindWorkCenter; string;  Name; string;  of the work center to inspect if the inspection plan type is Resource. </li><li>bindWorkCenterId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the work center to inspect if inspection plan type is Resource. </li></ul></li><li>findSecuredInspectionPlans Finds inspection plans based on the data privilege name specified. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>bindPrivilege; string;  Name; string;  of the data privilege. </li></ul></li></ul>",
