            "productionSchedulingPlans-peggingRelationships-finder":{
                "name":"finder",
                "in":"query",
                "description":"Used as a predefined finder to search the collection.<br><br>Format ?finder=&lt;finderName&gt;;&lt;variableName&gt;=&lt;variableValue&gt;,&lt;variableName2&gt;=&lt;variableValue2&gt;<br><br>The following are the available finder names and corresponding finder variables<br><br><ul><li>PrimaryKey Finds supply and demand pegging. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>PeggingId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the supply and demand pegging relationship. </li><li>PlanId; integer;  Value that uniquely identifies the production schedule. </li></ul></li><li>findByGroupCode Finds the pegging records for tasks included in the group by group code. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>GroupCode; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findByGroupId Finds the pegging records for tasks included in the group by primary key. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>GroupId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByOnHandInventoryItem Finds downstream demand for on-hand quantity by item number. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>ItemCode; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByOnHandInventoryItemId Finds downstream demand for on-hand quantity by the unique identifier of the item. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>InventoryItemId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByOnHoldLot Finds downstream demand by item inventory code and on-hold lot. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>ItemCode; string;   </li><li>LotNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByOnHoldLotAndItemId Finds downstream demand by the unique identifier of the item and on-hold lot. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>InventoryItemId; integer;   </li><li>LotNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamBySupply Finds downstream demand and supply by item supply. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>SupplyLineItemNumber; string;   </li><li>SupplyNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamBySupplyId Finds downstream demand by the unique identifier of the supply. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>SupplyId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByWorkOrder Finds downstream supply by work order number. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>FromWorkOrderNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByWorkOrderId Finds downstream demand by the unique identifier of the work order. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>FromWorkOrderId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByWorkOrderOperation Finds downstream demand by operation code. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>FromOperationSequenceNumber; number;   </li><li>FromResourceSequenceNumber; integer;   </li><li>FromWorkOrderNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findDownstreamByWorkOrderOperationId Finds downstream demand by the unique identifier of the work order operation. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>FromResourceSequenceNumber; integer;   </li><li>FromWorkOrderOperationId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findUpstreamByDemand Finds upstream supply by demand. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>DemandLineItemNumber; string;   </li><li>DemandNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findUpstreamByDemandId Finds upstream supply by the unique identifier of the demand. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>DemandId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findUpstreamByWorkOrder Finds upstream supply by work order number. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>ToWorkOrderNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findUpstreamByWorkOrderId Finds upstream supply by the unique identifier of the work order. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>ToWorkOrderId; integer;   </li></ul></li><li>findUpstreamByWorkOrderOperation Finds upstream supply by operation code. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>ToOperationSequenceNumber; number;   </li><li>ToResourceSequenceNumber; integer;   </li><li>ToWorkOrderNumber; string;   </li></ul></li><li>findUpstreamByWorkOrderOperationId Finds upstream supply by the unique identifier of the work order operation. <br>Finder Variables <ul><li>ToResourceSequenceNumber; integer;   </li><li>ToWorkOrderOperationId; integer;   </li></ul></li></ul>",
